& [ImportedPrimaryFindings]
  + RFC8259 duplicate member behavior is not reliably interoperable; strict declaration-order parsing refuses ambiguity
  + Rust serde closed structs and enums require explicit deny-unknown and canonical serialization tests
  + Unicode security guidance treats controls and confusables as spoofing surfaces; reference grammar remains narrow ASCII-safe metadata
  + Windows reparse attributes distinguish redirects; evidence rejects them without claiming atomic snapshot guarantees
  + a digest binds supplied bytes and proves no provenance authority confidentiality availability or truth of an inaccessible referent
& [AppliedDecision]
  + no locator or secret store protocol; separate transport hash typed self-digest descriptor equality and semantic mismatch
  + reuse published A6 research and contracts unchanged
& [Nonclaim]
  + no confidential permit standard issuer policy hardware custody or deployment is selected
